Z||000000||BOILERMAKER||02-21-2000||04:07 PM||||I just checked with a guy here in my neighborhood this last week and he was going to put a V8 and slicks and yadayadayada, but he never did.  This last week he told me that his dad (the boy is quite a bit younger than me, but the bond between two fiero owners is timeless) wants it out of his garage.  Guess who came to the rescue to take the car off of his hands?  Yep, me!!!!!!!!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Anyway, 86SE (I think that's the year, I will check when I pick it up in a week or 2), 4cyl (engine out),sunroof (glass looks good), 2 air deflectors (the ones that go in place of the sunroof), sunroof plastic holder, he says the light motors still work, front euro nose fascia looks really good, inside is a little ragged, but I will check to see what else is good.  <P>Hey, for free I think I have quite a few good parts to offer.<P>I don't think this car has ever seen any structural damage (again, I will have to check much closer), so if someone has kit car in mind, let me know.<P>WOOHOOHOO!!!!<P>[This message has been edited by BOILERMAKER (edited 02-21-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by BOILERMAKER (edited 02-21-2000).]||||reg||6
